// gh-841 review round 1 (IMPORTANT): the close-proof corroboration for the
// gh-840 sweep's head-advanced branch. A SILENT branch refresh
// (silentUpdateBranch) pushes a merge commit that advances the head
// WITHOUT resolving threads or running a leg — so an advanced head alone
